{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-04-28 18:22:00', 'title': 'MGM CHINA REPORTS 2021 FIRST QUARTER FINANCIAL DATA', 'text': 'POSITIONED FOR MARKET RECOVERY\xa0 MAINTAINED HEALTHY BALANCE SHEET HONG KONG, APRIL 29, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MGM CHINA HOLDINGS LIMITED ("MGM CHINA" OR THE "COMPANY"; SEHK STOCK CODE: 2282) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SELECTED UNAUDITED FINANCIAL DATA OF THE COMPANY AND ITS SUBSIDIARIES (THE "GROUP") FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2021 (THE "PERIOD"). MACAU WAS STILL UNDER THE SEVERE IMPACT OF COVID-19 PANDEMIC IN THE FIRST QUARTER THIS YEAR.'}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-04-28 16:15:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2021 FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, APRIL 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: MGM) ("MGM RESORTS" OR THE "COMPANY") TODAY REPORTED FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH\xa031, 2021. "WE ARE PLEASED WITH THE MEANINGFUL PROGRESS WE\'VE MADE ON MULTIPLE FRONTS THIS QUARTER," SAID BILL HORNBUCKLE, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT OF MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL.'}